# No silent platform breaks

Supported: Raspberry Pi OS, Jetson Nano, Linux, macOS, WSL.

- Do not bump Python, TensorFlow, or camera assumptions without updating `pyproject.toml` extras and `PYTHON312_MIGRATION.md` / install docs.
- Pi camera needs Debian `libcamera`/`picamera2` + venv `--system-site-packages` — do not remove that path.
- Prefer additive extras over one stack for every platform (TF on PC/Mac; TFLite/`ai-edge-litert` on Pi).
